{"task":"transcribe","language":"English","duration":62.287376384,"text":" Underneath it all is the AI operating layer. Three custom MCP integrations, Mattoon, NuExtract, and Pinecone. More than 40 apps connected to Claude through Mattoon, including QuickBooks, which had to be routed through Mattoon when a direct connection wasn't possible. Twilio and WhatsApp for sending and reading messages. And an email to SMS flow that texts a manager the moment Claude emails them. Global instructions give every agent, dashboard, and task the same rules, and a cleanup of skills and plugins keeps Claude's context focused. I also turned research reports into a structured research artifact and extracted and cleaned a local database to feed the dashboards. Across all of it, the same rules hold. Source-backed updates, verification kept apart from rights, every change auditable, no duplicates, each business isolated, Live dashboards and no guessing, ever. Manual operations turned into automated, auditable systems.","words":[{"word":"Underneath","start":0.2,"end":0.62},{"word":"it","start":0.62,"end":0.76},{"word":"all","start":0.76,"end":1.12},{"word":"is","start":1.12,"end":1.48},{"word":"the","start":1.48,"end":1.66},{"word":"AI","start":1.66,"end":2.02},{"word":"operating","start":2.02,"end":2.6},{"word":"layer.","start":2.6,"end":3.46},{"word":"Three","start":3.54,"end":3.74},{"word":"custom","start":3.74,"end":4.24},{"word":"MCP","start":4.24,"end":4.72},{"word":"integrations,","start":4.72,"end":5.92},{"word":"Mattoon,","start":5.92,"end":6.64},{"word":"NuExtract,","start":6.64,"end":7.38},{"word":"and","start":7.38,"end":7.52},{"word":"Pinecone.","start":7.52,"end":8},{"word":"More","start":8.58,"end":8.7},{"word":"than","start":8.7,"end":8.88},{"word":"40","start":8.88,"end":9.22},{"word":"apps","start":9.22,"end":9.48},{"word":"connected","start":9.48,"end":9.86},{"word":"to","start":9.86,"end":10.08},{"word":"Claude","start":10.08,"end":10.22},{"word":"through","start":10.22